   includes, without limitation, the right to use your Contribution in the
   official hosted instance at blueprint.raqameen.com and other official
   Raqameen domains, including where that instance is monetized through paid
   tiers, paid ad removal, or advertising, and the right to release the
   project under different license terms in the future.

4. **Patent grant.** You grant the Owner a perpetual, worldwide,
   non-exclusive, royalty-free, irrevocable patent license to make, have made,
